371
00:32:51,761 --> 00:32:52,720
Wait a minute.

372
00:32:53,221 --> 00:32:56,015
MY MIN-SUK

373
00:32:57,809 --> 00:32:59,936
Come on. Answer, please.

374
00:33:05,775 --> 00:33:08,361
The person
you're trying to reach is unavailable.

375
