who was trapped in the overturned car.

396
00:34:44,499 --> 00:34:45,458
Or in the school bus.

397
00:34:46,209 --> 00:34:48,169
Or in the burning building
I was running into.

398
00:34:59,180 --> 00:35:01,349
Honestly, this work is impossible to bear,

399
