…touch your savings accounts.

408
00:36:09,625 --> 00:36:10,960
We need to get in there!

409
00:36:12,003 --> 00:36:13,212
Right there.

410
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:16,090
Somebody help! Help her! Somebody help!

411
00:36:16,841 --> 00:36:18,718
