449
00:38:22,591 --> 00:38:24,385
I'm the one

450
00:38:24,468 --> 00:38:26,429
I will always be by your side…

451
00:38:26,512 --> 00:38:27,346
It's all right.

452
00:38:32,143 --> 00:38:34,437
I'll be that the light for you…

453
00:38:35,021 --> 00:38:37,565
