-I thought I was gonna die.

454
00:38:40,234 --> 00:38:41,193
I'm here. It's okay.

455
00:38:43,446 --> 00:38:44,947
You're okay. You're okay.

456
00:38:47,408 --> 00:38:50,536
Don't you worry cause I'm for you

457
