491
00:43:52,880 --> 00:43:53,922
Sang-ung!

492
00:43:59,136 --> 00:43:59,970
Damn it.

493
00:44:49,228 --> 00:44:50,813
Kang Sang-ung!

494
00:45:01,782 --> 00:45:02,908
