503
00:46:40,047 --> 00:46:42,299
You bastard! It's too damn hot in here!

504
00:46:43,133 --> 00:46:45,344
What a jerk.

505
00:46:56,355 --> 00:46:58,315
Oh, I'm so glad you're okay.

506
00:47:05,823 --> 00:47:07,699
